# GitHub

- Branch from `main`: `feat/...`, `fix/...`, `docs/...`, `refactor/...`, `test/...`, `chore/...`.
- Commits: `type(scope): why` — `feat(planner)`, `fix(compose)`, `docs(requirements)`, `test(engine)`. No “WIP” on `main`.
- Never `git commit --amend` of a pushed commit. Never `--no-verify`. Never force-push `main`.
- PRs use `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md`. Description says why; test plan is a checklist, not “works on my machine”.
- Do not commit secrets, `data/jobs`, or generated MP4. Review `.env` diffs as a blocker.
- Do not push unless the user asked.
